{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2011-meet-science2-05","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2011,"subject":"chemistry","number":5,"points":2,"unitId":"kinetics","unitLabel":"반응 속도론","topic":"속도결정단계·촉매","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["kinetics"],"stem":"그림은 A로부터 P가 생성되는 반응에 대하여 촉매를 사용하지 \n않은 경우(\n)와 촉매 B를 사용한 경우(\n)의 반응 좌표에 따른 \n퍼텐셜 에너지를 나타낸 것이다.\n촉매 B를 사용한 전체 반응에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>\n에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?  \n<보 기>\nㄱ. 반응 AB →P＋B가 속도 결정 단계이다.\nㄴ. AB는 전이 상태(활성화물)이다.\nㄷ. 정반응과 역반응의 속도는 모두 촉매를 사용하지 않은 반응\n보다 빠르다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]}],"answer":3,"acceptedAnswers":[3],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":392,"height":9,"region":0,"bbox":[65.88,29.515,156.8,3.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2011-meet-science2-05/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":430,"height":442,"region":0,"bbox":[78.68,73.115,172.0,176.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2011-meet-science2-05/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":776,"height":227,"region":0,"bbox":[14.68,313.515,310.4,90.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t008","t009","t010","t011","t012"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2011-meet-science2-05/03.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":3,"sourceRect":[430.12,152.885,759.1,606.382],"width":328.98,"height":453.497,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[65.88,29.515,156.8,3.6],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[78.68,73.115,172.0,176.8],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-